{"text": "Memorandum\n\n\u00bb Mr. John A. OfBriant, II be 12/11/89\nEmployee Benefits Manager\n\n\u2018wm Janis P. Hodges\nRecords Manager\n\nrm Records Due for Destruction\n\nAttached are lists of records belonging to your department which\nare due for destruction. Please review the lists for accuracy\nof destruction schedule. If any corrections are necessary, or\nif you wish the records to be held longer, note the new des-\ntruction date on the list. If the records should be destroyed\naccording to the current schedule, please note the list \"approv-\nea\" and initial. Either way, please return the list to me,\n\npreferably within ten working days. 4\nJk Tle fean e dostey\nge Ab F 1m\n\nT ke ho\n\nLRP",
